16. RUN COMMANDS
----------------

To verify the environment:

    python verify_env.py

To validate or create the dataset split:

    python split_data.py

To train the model:

    python train.py

To calibrate the conformal threshold:

    python calibrate.py

To evaluate test coverage:

    python evaluate.py

To audit OOD images:

    python evaluate_ood.py --src "D:\ood"

To start the web application using the existing artifacts:

    python app.py

To run the automated test suite:

    python -m unittest discover -s tests -v

Training, calibration, and evaluation can overwrite generated artifacts.
If the goal is only to use the current model, run app.py without rerunning
the training pipeline.


